CARVE-OUT — docs/SPRITE-DESIGN-LOCK.md

Copyright (c) 2026 HetCreep. All rights reserved.

(This read "HetCreep / Katomnoi Studio" until 2026-08-11, which reads as joint
ownership and contradicted the STANDING GRANT below — a licence is not something
you grant a co-owner. HetCreep holds the copyright; the Studio holds a licence.)

The MIT grant above does NOT apply to docs/SPRITE-DESIGN-LOCK.md. That file is
licensed separately under Creative Commons Attribution-NonCommercial-NoDerivatives
4.0 International (CC BY-NC-ND 4.0):

    https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-nd/4.0/

You may read it, quote it with attribution, and share it unchanged for
non-commercial purposes. You may not use it commercially, and you may not
distribute a modified version, without a separate written licence from the
copyright holder.

Every other file in this repository, including docs/SPRITE-CONFORMANCE.md,
remains under the MIT licence above.

STANDING GRANT — Katomnoi Studio (github.com/KatomnoiStudio)

Katomnoi Studio is granted a perpetual, irrevocable, royalty-free licence to
use, reproduce, modify, and create derivative works from
docs/SPRITE-DESIGN-LOCK.md, and to apply it in the Studio's own products and
services, including commercially.

This grant does NOT include the right to sublicense that file, or to distribute
it or substantial portions of it to third parties. An MIT-style grant would
include both, and either one would release the document to anyone who received
a copy — which is exactly what the CC BY-NC-ND terms exist to prevent. The
Studio may freely ship whatever it BUILDS from the document; the document
itself remains the copyright holder's to license.

If the copyright holder and Katomnoi Studio are the same legal person, this
grant is redundant but harmless. If they are not, it is the operative
permission and should be recorded outside this file as well.

SCOPE AND LIMITS OF THIS CARVE-OUT — read before relying on it

  1. It applies from the commit that introduced it onward. Earlier revisions of
     docs/SPRITE-DESIGN-LOCK.md were published in this public repository under
     MIT. A licence grant already made cannot be withdrawn for copies already
     distributed, and forks of this repository exist.

  2. "LegendofSoulTH" in the MIT notice above is a project name, not a legal
     person. For the carve-out to be enforceable the holder should be a named
     individual or a registered entity. This has not been settled.

  3. Measurements and factual data stated in that file are facts, and facts are
     not copyrightable in most jurisdictions. What this carve-out can protect is
     the selection, arrangement, and expression — not the numbers themselves.

  4. This carve-out was drafted by an AI assistant at the owner's direction and
     has NOT been reviewed by a lawyer. It is not legal advice. If anything of
     value depends on it, have a lawyer settle points 1 to 3 first.

